Description: A3 Core: the a3-core program and the Core machine's deployment
 The A3 program /usr/bin/a3-core: the window, the Core and the audio engine as
 roles of one binary, and the systemd user unit a3-engine.service, which runs
 its engine role without a window. It reads the OSC address truth from
 /usr/share/a3/a3-osc.json, its config from ~/.config/a3/engine/engine.json or
 /usr/share/a3-engine/engine.json, and the speaker layouts and IEM data from
 /usr/share/a3-engine/spatial. A headless JACK host for parity and load runs
 is shipped as a tool.
 .
 The deployment around it: the user units of the a3-main group, the network,
 display, realtime and PipeWire configuration of a Core machine, and the
 questions asked at install time.
